        : root.kind == IconKind.home ? "M 15 21 L 15 14 A 1 1 0 0 0 14 13 L 10 13 A 1 1 0 0 0 9 14 L 9 21 M 3 10 A 2 2 0 0 1 3.71 8.47 L 10.71 2.47 A 2 2 0 0 1 13.29 2.47 L 20.29 8.47 A 2 2 0 0 1 21 10 L 21 19 A 2 2 0 0 1 19 21 L 5 21 A 2 2 0 0 1 3 19 Z"
        : root.kind == IconKind.disc ? "M 2.5 12 A 9.5 9.5 0 1 0 21.5 12 A 9.5 9.5 0 1 0 2.5 12 Z M 9.5 12 A 2.5 2.5 0 1 0 14.5 12 A 2.5 2.5 0 1 0 9.5 12 Z M 6.5 12 A 5.5 5.5 0 0 1 12 6.5"
